  "reason": "The existing evidence is empty, so the first experiment should test a baseline multimodal configuration to establish whether combining RNA and image data provides value. This experiment tests the effect of multimodal fusion (concat) with simple encoders (pca_n2000 for RNA, resnet50 for image) and no aggregation, isolating the impact of fusion methods. It addresses the most critical design choice (multimodal vs single-modality) while keeping other factors minimal to avoid confounding variables."
